; isort-preserves-length.elab — insertion sort PRESERVES LENGTH: forall l. len(isort l) = len l. Companion to
; isort-sorted (together: isort produces a SORTED list of the SAME length — a cardinality invariant toward the
; permutation half). Proof: helper insert-preserves-length (forall l x. len(insert(l,x))=s(len l), induction on l +
; le case-split via booldec + the insert-reduce branch-commit lemmas), then induction on l applying it to (isort t, h).
(data 2 0 0 0) (data 3 1 1 0) (data 60 0 0 0) (data 61 2 0 1) (data 70 2 0 0) (data 80 0 0 0) (data 81 0 0 0)
